{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Regarding a donkey</b> — two times: here and the other (עני ורוכב על חמור) — speaks of the Messiah, for just as it is written here אשר ירשיעון, there too it speaks of him concerning whom it is written וברוח שפתיו ימית רשע." "<b>יאמר</b> — in gematria: זה מין הטענה." "<b>אשר יאמר כי הוא זה</b> — in gematria: מודה במקצת טענה."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The second occurrence is Isaiah 3:3; the Messianic verse is Isaiah 11:4, which also contains the word רשע linking to אשר ירשיעון here."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:02.021564354Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}